ertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LUB}_T(a,b;c)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_T(\\{a,b\\},c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LUB}_T(a,b;c)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_T(\\{a,b\\},c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文件 exact-pair 的三元式实际定义二元集合的最小上界，并不是递归论或解释度论中另有含义的 exact pair。本次仅更名，不将它改造成另一种数学概念。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"511859971a231477","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T$ 取 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$a,b,c\\in D_T$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"511859971a231477","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sup}_T$ 取 [[67-df-degree-bounds]]；$\\mathrm{LUB}_T$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D_T,\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sup}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LUB}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LUB}_T(a,b;c)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_T(\\{a,b\\},c).","display":true}],"bytes":1636,"backlinks":[{"id":"846ef15b034c9318","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$